---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "旅行者必携の中国語基本フレーズ";
const description = "旅行前に覚えておきたい中国語の基本フレーズ — 発音、使う場面、伝えるコツを解説。";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="ja">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/ja/life/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        ライフ編に戻る
      </a>
    </nav>
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🗣️ 中国での生活</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        旅行者必携の中国語基本フレーズ
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">ほんの十数フレーズで、現地の人からの対応が変わります。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最終更新: 2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 読了時間: 4分</span>
      </div>
    </header>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-emerald-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-4">🎯 ざっくり答えると</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-green-800 leading-relaxed">
        中国旅行に中国語は必須ではありません。しかし十数フレーズ覚えるだけで旅が格段に良くなります。現地の人は努力を本当に評価してくれ、サービスも笑顔も増え、市場では値段まで良くなることがあります。
      </p>
    </div>

        <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📋 目次</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#greetings" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">👋 挨拶と丁寧表現</a></li>
        <li><a href="#eating" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🍽️ 食事と注文</a></li>
        <li><a href="#shopping" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🛍️ 買い物と価格</a></li>
        <li><a href="#getting-around" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🚇 移動</a></li>
        <li><a href="#emergencies" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🆘 緊急時</a></li>
        <li><a href="#pronunciation" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🎵 発音のコツ</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="greetings" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">👋</span> 挨拶と丁寧表現
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">英語</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">ピンイン</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">備考</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Hello</td><td class="px-6 py-4">你好</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Nǐ hǎo</td><td class="px-6 py-4">誰にでもいつでも使える</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">Thank you</td><td class="px-6 py-4">谢谢</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Xiè xiè</td><td class="px-6 py-4">頻繁に言うと好印象</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Sorry / Excuse me</td><td class="px-6 py-4">对不起</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Duì bù qǐ</td><td class="px-6 py-4">人にぶつかった時など</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">It's okay</td><td class="px-6 py-4">没关系</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Méi guān xì</td><td class="px-6 py-4">「ごめんなさい」への返答</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Goodbye</td><td class="px-6 py-4">再见</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Zài jiàn</td><td class="px-6 py-4">標準的な別れの挨拶</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12"><strong>ヒント:</strong> レストラン、お店、タクシーなど、支払いのたびに「ありがとう」を言いましょう。日常のやりとりが格段にスムーズになります。</p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="eating" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🍽️</span> 食事と注文
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">英語</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">ピンイン</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">備考</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Check, please</td><td class="px-6 py-4">买单</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Mǎi dān</td><td class="px-6 py-4">手を少し上げて合図</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">Delicious!</td><td class="px-6 py-4">好吃！</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Hǎo chī!</td><td class="px-6 py-4">シェフを褒める</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">No spicy</td><td class="px-6 py-4">不加辣</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Bù jiā là</td><td class="px-6 py-4">四川・湖南では必須</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">Water, please</td><td class="px-6 py-4">请给我水</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Qǐng gěi wǒ shuǐ</td><td class="px-6 py-4">水道水は飲まないで</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="shopping" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🛍️</span> 買い物と価格
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">英語</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">ピンイン</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">備考</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">How much?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">多少钱？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Duō shǎo qián?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">値段を聞く万能表現</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">Too expensive</td><td class="px-6 py-4">太贵了</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Tài guì le</td><td class="px-6 py-4">市場でのみ使う</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Can you lower it?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">便宜一点？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Pián yí yì diǎn?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">市場向け、お店では不可</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">I'll take it</td><td class="px-6 py-4">我要这个</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Wǒ yào zhè ge</td><td class="px-6 py-4">決めた時に</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="getting-around" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🚇</span> 移動
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">英語</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">ピンイン</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">備考</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Where is...?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">...在哪里？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">...zài nǎ lǐ?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">場所名は中国語で表示</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">I'm going here</td><td class="px-6 py-4">去这里</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Qù zhè lǐ</td><td class="px-6 py-4">運転手に住所を見せる</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Stop here</td><td class="px-6 py-4">这里停</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Zhè lǐ tíng</td><td class="px-6 py-4">タクシーで</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">How long?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">多久？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Duō jiǔ?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">移動時間や待ち時間</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12"><strong>上級者向けヒント:</strong> 目的地は必ず中国語の文字で表示しましょう。</p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="emergencies" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🆘</span> 緊急時
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">英語</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">ピンイン</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">備考</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Help!</td><td class="px-6 py-4">救命！</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Jiù mìng!</td><td class="px-6 py-4">本当の緊急時にのみ</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">Call the police</td><td class="px-6 py-4">报警</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Bào jǐng</td><td class="px-6 py-4">緊急番号: 110</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">I need a doctor</td><td class="px-6 py-4">我需要医生</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Wǒ xū yào yī shēng</td><td class="px-6 py-4">緊急番号: 120</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">I'm lost</td><td class="px-6 py-4">我迷路了</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Wǒ mí lù le</td><td class="px-6 py-4">目的地を中国語で表示</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="pronunciation" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🎵</span> 発音のコツ
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">中国語には<strong>声調（トーン）</strong>があります — 同じ音節でも高低で意味が変わります。でも心配しすぎなくて大丈夫。文脈で意味は通じますし、現地の人は観光客に寛容です。</p>

      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">四つの声調:</p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">声調</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">例</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">意味</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">説明</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">第1声</td><td class="px-6 py-4">mā (妈)</td><td class="px-6 py-4">お母さん</td><td class="px-6 py-4">高く平らに</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">第2声</td><td class="px-6 py-4">má (麻)</td><td class="px-6 py-4">麻痺する</td><td class="px-6 py-4">上がる調子</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">第3声</td><td class="px-6 py-4">mǎ (马)</td><td class="px-6 py-4">馬</td><td class="px-6 py-4">下がって上がる</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">第4声</td><td class="px-6 py-4">mà (骂)</td><td class="px-6 py-4">叱る</td><td class="px-6 py-4">急激に下げる</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12"><strong>一番のコツ:</strong> ゆっくりはっきり話すこと。多くの中国人は外国人が声調に苦労するのを理解しており、理解しようと努力してくれます。</p>
    </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 関連ガイド</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/ja/life/survival-kit/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🎒 中国旅行サバイバルキット</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">出発前の完全チェックリスト</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/ja/life/essential-apps/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">📱 中国で必要な10のアプリ</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">翻訳ツールを含む必須アプリ</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/ja/life/cultural-taboos/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🏮 中国のタブーとマナー</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">社交の場を自信を持って乗り切る</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  
    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">出典</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
        <li>語学参考 — 単一の公式出典はありません。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>